5, from spell levels 6-11; the exclusion of metamorphosis and summoning spells cannot be filtered and is in each schedule note. || SKILLS: the R.C.C. skills as occ_skills at catalog base plus the printed bonus: basic math 45+30, land navigation 36+10 at 4 per level, wilderness survival 30+15, Identify Plants & Fruit 25+5, detect ambush 30+5, detect concealment 25+5, faerie lore is Lore: Faeries & Creatures of Magic 25+5, demon lore is Lore: Demons & Monsters 25+5, art 35+15, dance 30+10. No languages or literacy are printed (it communicates psionically); none are added. R.C.C. Related Skills: None! and Secondary Skills: None!, so neither block. || SPECIAL MAGIC KNOWLEDGE (ley line senses, transmission, phasing, and the recognize percentages) is an ability in prose. || Alignment (any, usually principled, scrupulous or unprincipled), weight 6-10 lbs, length 3-5 ft, average level 1D4, life span 300 years (half or less as a bio-wizard component), slave market value (400,000 to 600,000 credits) are in the body. No starting money or equipment is printed."
